    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d380">

                <pb facs="0496" n="416" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg416"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. de Margerie.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-30"><hi rendition="#italic">September 30,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 509.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 25th instant, expressing anew the thanks of the Government
                    of <pb facs="0497" n="417" xml:id="pg417"/> the French Republic for the aid
                    extended by the United States to the sufferers in the recent volcanic eruption
                    of Mont Pélée.</p>
                <p>It was with gratification that I made this known to the Secretary of the
                    Navy.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
